      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand the intensity of the fear you are feeling and the desperate hope for a way out.\nHowever, suicide in the end of a life is not a way to end life with honor.\nPlease do not end it yourself; life is still something to be lived and to help you begin a new beginning.\nI hope you can find a safe way to end the suffering you feel and start a new life.",
